WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.584
Collaborate and listen.

00:00:01.584 --> 00:00:03.503
Ice is back with a
brand new invention.

00:00:03.503 --> 00:00:05.463
Something grabs
ahold of me tightly.

00:00:05.463 --> 00:00:07.590
Flow like a harpoon
daily and nightly.

00:00:07.590 --> 00:00:08.425
Will it ever stop?

00:00:08.425 --> 00:00:09.634
Yo, I don't know.

00:00:09.634 --> 00:00:11.761
Turn off the lights
and I'll glow.

00:00:11.761 --> 00:00:13.596
To the extreme I rock
a mic like a vandal.

00:00:13.596 --> 00:00:14.973
Light up a stage and wax
a chump like a candle.

00:00:14.973 --> 00:00:16.224
All right, stop.
Can someone unlock the car?

00:00:17.058 --> 00:00:17.934
Go rush to the
speaker that booms.

00:00:17.934 --> 00:00:20.103
I'm killing your brain
like a poisonous mushroom.

00:00:20.103 --> 00:00:20.895
Deadly.

00:00:20.895 --> 00:00:23.231
When I play a dope melody,
anything less than the best

00:00:23.231 --> 00:00:24.274
is a felony.

00:00:24.274 --> 00:00:25.150
Love it or leave it.

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:26.026
You better gangway.

00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:28.278
Pretty impressive, huh?

00:00:28.278 --> 00:00:29.070
How good is mom?

00:00:29.070 --> 00:00:30.488
Problem,
yo, I'll solve it.

00:00:30.488 --> 00:00:32.615
Check out the hook
while my DJ revolves it.

00:00:32.615 --> 00:00:34.451
Ice, ice baby.

